# Markdown notes

- YAML frontmatter where a template exists (`docs/papers/_template.md`).
- Wikilinks: `[[relative/path/no-ext]]` or `[[path|label]]`.
- Cross-link papers and topic folders; keep filenames stable (`kebab-case`).
